{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大族數控截至九月底止第三季度，按年多賺近1.6倍，純利5.87億元人民幣。扣除非經常性損益純利5.82億元人民幣，同樣增長近1.6倍。</p><p></p><p>收入增長近八成八，至超過28億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T00:00:14.508151+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:39.294962+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:57:48.508027+00:00","content_hash":"ca0f7bf1a875b87e2431671b1dcea74543b8291f8fcf1c6f4b9c655879e20bad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}